Z||000003||sqoach||11-29-2000||12:28 AM||||first get a nice head unit.  here's a pic of the one i'm thinking about getting:<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pioneercd.JPG">   <P>it's a din and 1/2 size so it fits the fiero just fine. i've seen a pic of it installed, just forgot where.  i think it runs about $250-300.<BR>replace your 4x10s with another pair.(i like the sound of the 4x10s, that's what i replaced them with another pair) and the 4x6s i would replace with some 4x6 plates.  i don't have any, but i've heard they sound good.  and if you want some good bass, check out stimp's footwell sub and that should give you a good idea.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004534.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004534.html</A> <BR>------------------<BR>sQoaCh<P>[This message has been edited by sqoach (edited 11-29-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by sqoach (edited 11-29-2000).]||||reg||6
